## 5. Comprehensive Unit Test Vectors & Verification Matrix

The test suite in `tests/txt_telemetry_decoders.rs` and unit tests in `battery.rs` must cover every edge case and conversion formula:

### Test Case 1: Variant A Energy Summary Parsing
- **Input Bytes**: `[0x58, 0x60, 0x3B, 0xD8, 0x0E, 0x94, 0x11, 0x04, 0xA6, 0x0B]`
